# Gate files (coding standard CS-GA-1): a change to any of these needs the
# security owner's review ("Require review from Code Owners" on main).
# Until a second maintainer exists the approval is a recorded
# self-approval line in the pull request (security scope 9.2, SEC-6).
# The standard names the role, not a handle; the repository owner holds
# it. Paths that do not exist yet are listed so they are owned from the
# commit that creates them.

